    "Each terrain .tscn is an editor-visible authored room; its runtime wrapper lives under scenes/rooms/a2_fog_forest/runtime/.",
    "scenes/ash_forest.tscn is a compatibility alias to the R01 runtime scene. A1 north gate routes directly to R01.",
    "R01->R04 drop trigger uses Marker2D (1320,850), width 960 and height 260; R03->R04 uses Marker2D (425,675), width 150 and height 220. H02 is placed on the R04 crypt landing (90,380) and returns to R04 EntryH02Return (350,380).",
